                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Rhino Breps and/or Rhino Meshes for which incident radiation analysis
will be conducted. If Breps are input, they will be subdivided using
the _grid_size to yeild individual points at which analysis will
occur. If a Mesh is input, radiation analysis analysis will be
performed for each face of this mesh instead of subdividing it.</item>
